  "details": "# Issue: \n\nRight now the Instance Creation Menu is one list with all of the different instance types as well as a button to get to the group instance creation. This is in my opinion not the best layout as pressing on Group brings you to a new page compared to what the other buttons do. The region selection at the bottom of the menu also doesn't matter for Group Instances as they have their own region selection later on in process.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nSplit the Instance Creation Menu into two tabs you can switch between, one for normal Instances and one for Group Instances. Depending on what type of instance people want to create they could just switch between the two tabs.\n\nThis would in my opinion really help with organizing that menu more, especially as things like the region selection doesn't matter for group instances.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere are pictures on how I can imagine it looking:\n\nEdit: Whoops, ignore the back arrow on the group one please xD",
